WEBVTT

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.195
Sometimes you want help with a form,

00:00:05.195 --> 00:00:09.525
but you'd rather not show anyone your numbers, your name, or your town.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.625
Every number, traced to its page.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:18.260
Every document in your workspace is listed here, tagged with the form it holds.

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:22.290
To see inside one without its values, taxtrace has two views.

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:27.643
The first is the outline: each page's first lines,

00:00:27.643 --> 00:00:31.780
so you can see which forms a document holds, and in what order.

00:00:31.780 --> 00:00:34.210
Names and amounts are already masked.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:38.190
The second is the redacted layout.

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:42.862
It keeps the form's shape, and replaces every digit with a pound sign,

00:00:42.862 --> 00:00:45.733
and every name, street and town with stars.

00:00:45.733 --> 00:00:48.870
That is safe to show to whoever is helping you.
